Changes to v1.04
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
And again fixed some bugs in the Utility and added some cosmentic changes
and converted the code to the new /X v3.20+ standard /Xnet. A Major Bug
was removed which don`t transfer ALL Needed Netmails for Uploading to
the HOST BBS. NEED A NEW CONFIG !!!

Changes to v1.05
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
Fixed several Bugs and included the new "AUTOUPDATE" in the MRUpdate
execution, that will fix problems with the BBS:AMIXNET/<NetiD>/<NetConf>.bin
files some people don`t know. But make sure to start MRUpdate one time with
the AUTOUPDATE option on.

